        "created_at": "2012-08-20T20:19:30.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>My recommendations for advanced chaiman are as follows:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>DON'T.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Apart from that, the best way to handle him is to Savage Mana all his guys, so the +H damage won't do anything.</p><p>I don't have IR yet (damn typhoons) so I don't know about the Ennead, but I've heard that they are hard. I think the Matriarch is harder than the chairman, myself. They are pretty close though.</p>",
