        "created_at": "2012-08-20T22:07:51.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I consider the Matriarch very easy but maybe I've just been very lucky. I've beaten her 4 or 5 times in a row and the most recent time all four of my heroes were in the low twenties or the upper teens. She really only has the one trick of damaging you whenever you take out a fowl, if you can nullify that then you're pretty set.&nbsp;</p>",
